<title>UK: Commonwealth sends team to observe Ghana election.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth sends team to observe Ghana election.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth said on Tuesday it will send a 14-strong team to observe Ghana's presidential and parliamentary elections on December 7.</p>
<p>The team will be led by Sir Paul Reeves, former governor-general of New Zealand, a Commonwealth statement said.</p>
